---
import SiteLayout from '@/layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout
  title="About FashionPlusBeauty | For every side of your style"
  description="Meet FashionPlusBeauty: an editorial home for women's fashion, beauty and thoughtful everyday living."
  canonicalPath="/about/"
>
  <section class="static-page-hero" aria-labelledby="about-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">A little about us</p>
    <h1 id="about-title">For every side of your style.</h1>
    <p>Fashion, beauty and all the good in between—thoughtfully edited for women making life their own.</p>
  </section>
  <div class="prose-page">
    <p>Welcome to <strong>FashionPlusBeauty</strong>, your everyday edit for living beautifully. We believe style should feel like self-expression, beauty should leave room for real life, and a good idea is even better when it is easy to make your own.</p>

    <h2>What you will find here</h2>
    <p>Our pages bring together wearable outfit inspiration, approachable beauty notes, thoughtful shopping guides and small lifestyle rituals. We write for women with full lives, different budgets, changing tastes and no interest in following rules just because they are rules.</p>
    <p>Expect useful details, a friendly point of view and ideas to save for later. Some stories are made to help you get dressed in five minutes; others are a reminder to slow down and enjoy the day you are already having.</p>

    <h2>How we think about recommendations</h2>
    <p>We want the difference between an editorial idea, a product mention and a paid relationship to be clear. If we add affiliate links or sponsored content, we will identify them in a way readers can see. Any product links and partnerships are being set up; the site currently uses editorial sample content.</p>
    <p>Beauty stories are for general informational purposes and are not a substitute for personalized advice from a qualified professional. Always use products according to their directions and seek professional guidance for individual concerns.</p>

    <div class="contact-card">
      <p class="eyebrow">Have a note for us?</p>
      <strong>We would love to hear from you.</strong>
      <p>For editorial ideas, press or partnership inquiries, visit our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>
